			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 130320501,
					"content": "這裡，就是終點了吧，可是沒看見蘭那羅，只有這塊很大的石頭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320502,
					"content": "太開心了，這種感覺我幾乎都已經忘掉了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320503,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們知道嗎？如果不跑起來，我覺得我的世界只有那麼一點。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320504,
					"content": "但只要不斷往前跑，眼前就會不斷出現新的景色，世界會無限地在我眼前展開。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320505,
					"content": "#雖然我不知道我是怎麼做到的，但一定是{M#哥哥姐姐們}{F#姐姐們}的功勞吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320506,
					"content": "哎呀，這個不重要。關鍵是妳想起了很多事啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320507,
					"content": "記憶不止象徵過去，同樣擁有照亮未來的力量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320508,
					"content": "只要養好了病，這些快樂就都會回到妳的身邊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320509,
					"content": "#嗯，謝謝姐姐，也謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320510,
					"content": "那我們繼續去找蘭莎妮吧，他好像不在這裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320511,
					"content": "是啊，但為什麼會把我們引到這裡來呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320512,
					"content": "我也覺得這個石頭很顯眼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320513
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130320513,
					"content": "我也說不上來，不知道它是什麼，但總有一種很熟悉的感覺…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320514,
					"content": "就好像「它」本來就是我的一部分。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320515,
					"content": "我知道了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320516,
					"content": "這個石頭，是不是就是屬於她的「蒼松石」啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320517,
					"content": "蒼、蒼松石？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320518,
						130320519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320518,
					"content": "（宵宮真是會編。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320520
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130320519,
					"content": "（我都快把這事忘了。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320520
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130320520,
					"content": "那是一種很稀有的礦石，象徵的正是一個人的初心與夢想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320521,
					"content": "妳能見到它，就表示妳已經把妳失去的東西找回來了啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320522,
					"content": "原來是這樣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320523,
					"content": "怎麼和童話故事一樣，本來我都不相信童話了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320524,
					"content": "但是，真好啊，我找回來了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320525,
					"content": "欸，穿、穿過去了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320526,
					"content": "我們也過去！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320527,
					"content": "#喂，喂，宵宮！唉，沒辦法了，{NICKNAME}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320528,
					"content": "穿過來了，但周圍好像沒什麼變化…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320529,
					"content": "好久不見，那菈艾文。好久不見了，對嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭莎妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320530,
					"content": "蘭莎妮…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320531,
					"content": "為什麼要露出悲傷的樣子，哦，蘭莎妮明白了，這是開心的樣子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320532
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭莎妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320532,
					"content": "蘭莎妮！嗚哇哇啊啊啊——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320533
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾文"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320533,
					"content": "哈哈哈，蘭那羅為我們準備的旅程，真是浪漫啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320534
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320534,
					"content": "不僅是讓她找回了最重要的朋友，也讓我們知道了「蒼松石」究竟是什麼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320535
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320535,
					"content": "等一下我們也要去找屬於我們的「蒼松石」哦，我一定要做出最純淨的透鏡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320536
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320536,
					"content": "嗯！不知道為什麼，我也有一種能做到的感覺！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320537,
						130320538
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320537,
					"content": "這就是冒險吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320539
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130320538,
					"content": "我也樂在其中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320539
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130320539,
					"content": "不過首先還是得先把她送回須彌城，不要讓她的母親太擔心了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宮"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320540,
					"content": "#眼前的場景如夢似幻，恍惚之間，{F#妳}{M#你}們又回到了原處。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1303206,
